I am opening this thread so our updates on the Barrera Group positioning work=
 stay in one place, and I have attached the kickoff memo so the plan is in fr=
ont of you as we go. For the file, the working contacts are set: Mary Frank o=
n your side, and on ours Michelle Rose, who is drafting the core messaging, w=
ith me handling the engagement day to day.

We have made a start. Michelle Rose is turning the kickoff conversation into =
a first set of messages, and we expect a draft to you late this week. You wil=
l hear from us on a steady cadence from here, and each note will be tied to t=
he piece of work it concerns, so the thread stays easy to follow.

One thing would help before that draft hardens: your read on which audience c=
omes first. If the operations story and the investor story pull in different =
directions, tell me now and we will build to it. A short call works if that i=
s easier than writing it out.

